 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ b (lane kit-batch-2005b-20261122), hand-authored from w01-64d25 2025-10-02 (re-cropped with a date filter: the archived w01-64 2020-02-07 is the building site). Groups 0-5 are the street base panels 85, 69, 143, 43, 11, 35 from the SE end (left in the crop) to the NW: a tall ground of glazed doors, a storey of wide four-light windows and the first setback storey of deep brick-framed recesses that 3DBAG merges into the base (eaves 9.7 m); panels 43 and 11 carry the two round-arched gateways. Groups 6-11 are the setback panels 142, 58, 19, 144, 29, 44 (eaves 16 m): deep brick-framed window recesses on every storey. Courtyard and side walls take otherWalls (no straight crop).",
  "The gateways are two storeys tall in the photo (crown at the base parapet); the kit gateway is one ground storey tall with plain brick above it in storey 1."
 ],
